stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> in_progress: StartAttempt
    in_progress --> in_progress: AutosaveAttempt (draft_answers, draft_saved_at)
    in_progress --> submitted: SubmitAttempt
    submitted --> submitted: re-aggregate via FinalizeAttempt
    submitted --> graded_notified: maybeFinalizeAttempt → "Exam Graded"

    note right of in_progress
      one row per (user_id, exam_id)
      idempotent on re-entry
    end note
    note right of submitted
      submissions array fully created
      draft_answers cleared (NULL)
    end note
